  user_1,But I uploaded that already in the chat. Did they get it?
  user_2,Yes they have it. It's just under review. Usually it takes a few hours but sometimes up to 24 hrs
  user_1,Ah okay I was hoping it would be immediate. Any way to expedite?
  user_2,Unfortunately I can't fast‑track it but I can flag it as urgent since you’ve completed payment
  user_1,Thanks I appreciate that. Also could you send me a copy of the policy terms again just in case
  user_2,Sure thing—I’ll email you the final policy PDF with the cover page highlighted. Expect it in the next 10 minutes
  user_1,Alright thanks. One more thing—if I need to file a claim what's the first thing I should do
  user_2,First call our 24/7 claims hotline give them your policy number (we’ll include it in the email) and they'll guide you through the documentation
  user_1,Got it thanks for all the info. I'll wait for the email and the activation status
